# SE-EDU Java coding standard

All Java code in this project MUST follow the SE-EDU Java coding standard (basic + intermediate).

When writing, editing, reviewing, or generating Java (including tests and Javadoc):

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/seedu-java-coding-standard/SKILL.md`.
2. Apply every basic and intermediate rule in that skill.
3. For topics not covered there, follow the Google Java Style Guide.

Do not skip this skill for Java work in this repository.
